[162.408186, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[36m▸ 22. Retrieval policy — GEPA-tuned, promotable\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2mThe GEPA loop runs against the real stack and produces a candidate RetrievalPolicy (ComposedIndex weights + score floor + answer weights). tracemind policy set <report> promotes it in-place. tracemind rollback list reverses any promotion.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[164.417874, "o", "\r\n\u001b[33m$ ./target/release/tracemind policy show\u001b[0m\r\n"]
