[176.52881, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[36m▸ 24. Export — your memory is yours\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2mThe whole graph as a portable Obsidian-compatible markdown bundle: one file per entity with [[wikilinks]] + index.md. Trust artifact and data path for PKM workflows.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
